test: distinct terminators describe nested definitions without macro evaluation
The nested body stays opaque; invocation is preserved as an unknown control.
-- input.1 --
.de OUTER OUTEREND
first raw line
.de INNER INNEREND
.B body
.INNEREND
.ig IGNOREEND
ignored .SH is not a section
.IGNOREEND
.OUTEREND
.am OUTER APPENDEND
later body
.APPENDEND
.OUTER
-- expected-extract.txt --
OUTER OUTEREND
first raw line
INNER INNEREND
.B body
IGNOREEND
ignored .SH is not a section
OUTER APPENDEND
later body
.OUTER
